{"product_id":"bump-cap","title":"LX1 Bump Cap","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe Vuzix bump cap is a lightweight, comfortable head protection solution designed for environments where minor bumps and scrapes are a risk, but a full hard hat isn’t required. Featuring a durable inner shell and a stylish outer cap, it blends safety with everyday wearability. Compatible with Vuzix M400 and LX1 hat-clip mounts, the bump cap is ideal for warehouses, maintenance work, and low-risk industrial settings.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix Corporation","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":56389759107238,"sku":"516T0A013","price":49.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/DSC00269.jpg?v=1776347602","url":"https:\/\/www.vuzix.com\/products\/bump-cap","provider":"Vuzix Corporation","version":"1.0","type":"link"}